    description: "Ökologische Fußabdrücke von Lebensmitteln und Gerichten in Deutschland
      (Heidelberg 2020). Table 6: carbon footprints of eight ready-to-eat dishes,
      system boundary 'prepared on the plate', kg CO2e per portion, reference year
      2019. Kitchen processes are those of a four-person household. The dishes are
      examples chosen to show the range for meat, vegetarian and vegan dishes, not
      averages.; Format: PDF; Licensing: Reproduction with attribution; Geographic
      Coverage: Germany; Date Last Updated: 2020; Updated by: ifeu"
